<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended July 4, compared with the June 27 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.82 vs 5.42</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.04 vs 4.99</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.63 vs 5.63</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.58 vs 5.58</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.66 vs 5.66</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.65 vs 5.63</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.72 vs 6.73</p>
</text>
